'''November Gauntlet II''' (続・11月強襲！, ''Zoku・11 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''Continued・November Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during November and was added in the [[Version 10.10 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Worker's Revolution (Monthly Event)|Worker's Revolution]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
November Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Revolution Lvs''' (レボリューション Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Revolution Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[November Gauntlet II/Revolution Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*November Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Worker's Revolution (Monthly Event)|Worker's Revolution]].

